        {
          "name": "Aqualung",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "A dhorme chimera can emit a 30-ft.-cone of watery breath, once every 1d4 rounds. Creatures within the area of effect take 8d6 points of water damage and are inflicted with Silence status (Reflex save DC 18 to reduce damage by half and negate the Silence status effect) for 1d6 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 4th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 23).",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Fulmination",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "A dhorme chimera can launch a powerful blast of lightning against creatures within 60 ft. in a 20-ft.-radius, once every 1d3 rounds. Creatures in the area of effect take 10d6 points of lightning damage are inflicted with Disable status for 1d4 rounds, a successive Reflex save (DC 18) for half damage and negates status effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 5th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 25).",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "This winged monster has the body of a lion, though two more heads flank its central feline one - a dragon and a horned goat. They tend to ambush wondering parties in the desert."
